MCE = CPU-reported hardware error
Built into x86 CPUs​ (Intel/AMD)
Reports:
Memory DIMM errors (correctable / uncorrectable)
Cache errors
Bus errors
CPU internal faults
Handled by:
Kernel (mcesubsystem)
Userspace daemons (mcelog, rasdaemon)
IPMI SEL (BMC logs)
If PostgreSQL crashes due to hardware, you always​ see MCE entries.

ipmitool sel list
This queries BMC (Baseboard Management Controller)​ hardware logs.
Looks for:
Memory ECC errors
DIMM failures
Power faults
